WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.380
I used to have to handle

2
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.980
every message myself.

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.420
When messages came at night

4
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.780
or when I was busy,

5
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:06.580
I couldn’t keep up

6
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.570
with the volume.

7
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.250
That’s a digital responder

8
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.130
in Turkey.

9
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:11.170
The field team:

10
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.160
two people.

11
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.840
So at Zogreo,

12
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.960
we ran a pilot.

13
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.720
Our AI leads each person

14
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.320
through three Bible studies,

15
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.440
answers their questions,

16
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.610
and follows up.

17
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.760
Those who finish,

18
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.280
and obey in faith,

19
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.560
are handed to the team

20
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.680
on the ground.

21
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.130
The result:

22
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.490
the same team could serve

23
00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.420
3.73 times as many people.

24
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:33.090
And they found

25
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.370
disciple-making leaders

26
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.860
at about the same rate.

27
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.600
One more thing.

28
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.040
Many who answer these ads

29
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.000
are hostile,

30
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.160
and responders take the abuse.

31
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.120
In the pilot,

32
00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.800
our AI took it instead,

33
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.480
and answered graciously.

34
00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.240
In the responder’s words:

35
00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.200
I don’t have to deal with

36
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.680
inappropriate or profane comments,

37
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.040
and I get to spend more time

38
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:54.600
on the people

39
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.090
that are most interested.

40
00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.220
Our AI doesn’t replace

41
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:00.100
the team.

42
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.620
It multiplies them.

43
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.420
Book a call,

44
00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:02.900
or give,

45
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.910
at zogreo.org.
